[{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31400200_02_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31400200_02_0010","text":"哇！\n原来如此！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31400200_02_0020","text":"小奈……？\n怎么了……？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31400200_02_0030","text":"听说复活节\n是吃蛋料理来庆祝的哦！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31400200_02_0040","text":"这样啊……\n那个，蛋料理……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31400200_02_0041","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31400200_02_0050","text":"……嘿嘿\n甜花酱……？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31400200_02_0060","text":"不只是煎蛋和玉子烧，\n“那个”也是蛋料理哦？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31400200_02_0061","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31400200_02_0070","text":"……？\n咦……？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31400200_02_0080","text":"你看，甘奈们最喜欢的\n黄色的、甜甜的——？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31400200_02_0090","text":"……！\n布丁……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31400200_02_0100","text":"答对了！也就是说复活节\n也可以开布丁派对的哦！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31400200_02_0101","text":"Motion"}]
